00D4C7  1  A6 B9        NTHIS: LDX TXTPTR ;RESTORE TEXT POINTER.
00D4C9  1  E6 0F        INC COUNT ;INCREMENT RES WORD COUNT.
00D4CB  1  C8           NTHIS1: INY
