00D4CF  1  10 FA        BPL NTHIS1 ;END OF ENTRY?
00D4D1  1  B9 80 D0     LDA RESLST,Y;YES. IS IT THE END?
00D4D4  1  D0 B4        BNE RESCON ;NO, TRY THE NEXT WORD.
00D4D6  1  BD 00 02     LDA BUFOFS,X ;YES, END OF TABLE. GET 1ST CHR.
00D4D9  1  10 BE        BPL GETBPT ;STORE IT AWAY (ALWAYS BRANCHES).
00D4DB  1  99 FD 01     CRDONE: STA BUF-3,Y;SO THAT IF THIS IS A DIR STATEMENT
