00D79F  1               ; A GOSUB ENTRY ON THE STACK HAS THE FOLLOWING FORMAT:
00D79F  1               ;
00D79F  1               ; LOW ADDRESS:
00D79F  1               ;	THE GOSUTK ONE BYTE
00D79F  1               ;	THE LINE NUMBER OF THE GOSUB STATEMENT TWO BYTES
