00DDAB  1               ; MOST FUNCTIONS TAKE A SINGLE ARGUMENT.
00DDAB  1               ; THE RETURN ADDRESS OF THESE FUNCTIONS IS "CHKNUM"
00DDAB  1               ; WHICH ASCERTAINS THAT [VALTYP]=0  (NUMERIC).
00DDAB  1               ; NORMAL FUNCTIONS THAT RETURN STRING RESULTS
