00DDAB  1               ; RETURN DIRECTLY TO "FRMEVL".
00DDAB  1               ;
00DDAB  1               ; THE SO-CALLED "FUNNY" FUNCTIONS CAN TAKE MORE THAN ONE ARGUMENT,
