00DE49  1  F0 08        BEQ STASGN ;JUST PUT SIGN OF DIFFERENCE AWAY.
00DE4B  1  A9 01        LDA #1
00DE4D  1  90 04        BCC STASGN ;SIGN IS POSITIVE.
