00DF95  1               ;
00DF95  1               ; INTIDX READS A FORMULA FROM THE CURRENT POSITION AND
00DF95  1               ; TURNS IT INTO A POSITIVE INTEGER
00DF95  1               ; LEAVING THE RESULT IN FACMO&LO. NEGATIVE ARGUMENTS
00DF95  1               ; ARE NOT ALLOWED.
00DF95  1               ;
00DF95  1  20 B2 00     INTIDX: JSR CHRGET
