00E047  1               ;
00E047  1               ; HERE WHEN VARIABLE IS NOT FOUND IN THE ARRAY TABLE.
00E047  1               ;
00E047  1               ; BUILDING AN ENTRY.
00E047  1               ;
00E047  1               ;	PUT DOWN THE DESCRIPTOR.
00E047  1               ;	SETUP NUMBER OF DIMENSIONS.
00E047  1               ;	MAKE SURE THERE IS ROOM FOR THE NEW ENTRY.
00E047  1               ;	REMEMBER "VARPNT".
00E047  1               ;	TALLY=4.
00E047  1               ;	SKIP 2 LOCS FOR LATER FILL IN OF SIZE.
00E047  1               ; LOOP: GET AN INDICE
00E047  1               ;	PUT DOWN NUMBER+1 AND INCREMENT VARPTR.
00E047  1               ;	TALLY=TALLY*NUMBER+1.
00E047  1               ;	DECREMENT NUMBER-DIMS.
00E047  1               ;	BNE LOOP
00E047  1               ;	CALL "REASON" WITH [Y,A] REFLECTING LAST LOC OF VARIABLE.
00E047  1               ;	UPDATE STREND.
00E047  1               ;	ZERO ALL.
00E047  1               ;	MAKE TALLY INCLUDE MAXDIMS AND DESCRIPTOR.
00E047  1               ;	PUT DOWN TALLY.
00E047  1               ;	IF CALLED BY DIMENSION, RETURN.
00E047  1               ;	OTHERWISE INDEX INTO THE VARIABLE AS IF IT
00E047  1               ;	 WERE FOUND ON THE INITIAL SEARCH.
00E047  1               ;
00E047  1  20 80 DF     NOTFDD: JSR FMAPTR ;FORM ARYPNT.
