00E48B  1               ; "FRETMP" IS PASSED A STRING DESCRIPTOR PNTR IN [Y,A].
00E48B  1               ; A CHECK IS MADE TO SEE IF THE STRING DESCRIPTOR POINTS TO THE LAST
00E48B  1               ; TEMPORARY DESCRIPTOR ALLOCATED BY PUTNEW.
00E48B  1               ; IF SO, THE TEMPORARY IS FREED UP BY THE UPDATING OF [TEMPPT].
00E48B  1               ; IF A TEMP IS FREED UP, A FURTHER CHECK SEES IF THE STRING DATA THAT
00E48B  1               ; THAT STRING TEMP PNT'D TO IS THE LOWEST PART OF STRING SPACE IN USE.
00E48B  1               ; IF SO, [FRETOP] IS UPDATED TO REFLECT THE FACT THE FACT THAT THE SPACE
00E48B  1               ; IS NO LONGER IN USE.
