00EDF0  1               ; SUBTTL	POLYNOMIAL EVALUATOR AND THE RANDOM NUMBER GENERATOR.
00EDF0  1               ;EVALUATE P(X^2)*X
00EDF0  1               ;POINTER TO DEGREE IS IN [Y,A].
00EDF0  1               ;THE CONSTANTS FOLLOW THE DEGREE.
00EDF0  1               ;FOR X=FAC, COMPUTE:
00EDF0  1               ; C0*X+C1*X^3+C2*X^5+C3*X^7+...+C(N)*X^(2*N+1)
