00EE06  1               ;POLYNOMIAL EVALUATOR.
00EE06  1               ;POINTER TO DEGREE IS IN [Y,A].
00EE06  1               ;COMPUTE:
00EE06  1               ; C0+C1*X+C2*X^2+C3*X^3+C4*X^4+...+C(N-1)*X^(N-1)+C(N)*X^N.
00EE06  1               POLY:
00EE06  1  85 B0        STA POLYPT
